      "comment": "VELOCITY COMMIT (7) produced a moderate run last time when eighth at Q Lakeside over 390m behind Nangar Nugget (22.88) in a Grade 5. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to her credit. Tough to beat if on-song. CYCLONE TIM (2) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing seventh (19.38) at this track in a Grade 3/4. Can find the frame this time. HUNTER KAREN (3) was out of the placings last time when sixth at Cambridge Raceway (21.66) but did record second best time of the card when winning four back. One of the main contenders. JAG THE JOKER (1) can sneak into the finish.",
